# Files that must not be uploaded into the deployed container.
# `railway up` sends the working directory, which otherwise includes the
# dissertation, its figures and the test suites — none of which the running
# service needs, and the .docx alone is several megabytes.

*.docx
waste2value_figures/
tests/
e2e_test.cjs
disability-ims.html

# Build output is produced on Railway by `npm run build`; uploading a local
# dist/ risks deploying a stale bundle that does not match the source.
disability-ims-frontend/dist/

# Never upload local secrets — Railway holds its own variables.
.env
**/.env
